From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 07:53:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add offline map-sensitivity probe for distilled students

R7's iter-5000 p0 and gt_full evaluations produced byte-identical stats
files. That has two possible causes: the gt_full grid swap never reached the
map encoder (evaluation pipeline), or the student's actions do not depend on
the grid (model). map_sensitivity_probe.py separates them without the
simulator: it loads the DAgger checkpoint, encodes one episode's LLM grid and
GT grid (LLM metadata kept, as the swap does), and measures logit movement
and argmax flips on fixed synthetic graphs, against zeroed and removed maps.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
